  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-cooking\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Check out my other mod that connects Applied Energistics 2 and Cooking for Blockheads-Link at the bottom-edbd7e?labelColor=154a48&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Applied Cooking 宣傳圖\" width=\"845\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Refined_Cooking/BH_RC_Header.png\" alt=\"Refined Cooking 標頭\" width=\"1425\" height=\"479\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Available for Forge-1.19 | 1.18 | 1.16-e78a4e?labelColor=7f1620&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Minecraft 版本圖示\" width=\"306\" height=\"28\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Install on-Client & Server-e78a4e?labelColor=7f1620&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Refined Cooking 安裝圖示\" width=\"240\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmeloncube.net%252fsebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Refined_Cooking/BH_RC_Promo.png\" alt=\"Refined Cooking 宣傳圖\" width=\"1425\" height=\"211\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Refined_Cooking/BH_RC_Description.png\" alt=\"Refined Cooking 說明圖\" width=\"1425\" height=\"141\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">這是一個讓「精煉儲存 (Refined Storage)」與「方塊烹飪 (Cooking for Blockheads)」能協同工作的模組！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新增了兩個方塊（廚房工作站與廚房存取節點）以及一個物品（廚房網路卡）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">廚房工作站需放置於廚房網路中，而廚房存取節點則需放置於精煉儲存網路內。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">廚房工作站會作為精煉儲存網路的接收端，並需連接至一張廚房網路卡。接著，該廚房網路卡必須置入廚房存取節點中，後者將作為精煉儲存網路的發送端。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">完成連線設定後，你就能直接在烹飪桌上使用精煉儲存網路中的物品。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Refined_Cooking/BH_RC_Recipes.png\" alt=\"Refined Cooking 食譜\" width=\"1425\" height=\"650\"></p>\n<h2>方塊</h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>&nbsp;</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>已連接</strong></span></th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>未連接</strong></span></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>廚房工作站&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/gtdxpLS/2021-11-05-00-14-59.png\" alt=\"廚房工作站（已連接）\" width=\"400\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/MRnrBZ4/2021-11-05-00-00-52.png\" alt=\"廚房工作站（未連接）\" width=\"400\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>廚房存取節點&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/k1N7Xc0/2021-11-05-00-01-27.png\" alt=\"廚房存取節點（已連接）\" width=\"400\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Sm6M3MH/2021-11-04-23-58-08.png\" alt=\"廚房存取節點（未連接）\" width=\"400\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Refined_Cooking/BH_RC_Screenshot.png\" alt=\"Refined Cooking 遊戲截圖\" width=\"1808\" height=\"824\"></p>\n<h2>社群連結</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/itssebastrn/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=ItsSebastrn&color=e78a4e&labelColor=7f1620&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn 的 CurseForge\" width=\"148\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fItsSebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=@ItsSebastrn&color=e78a4e&labelColor=7f1620&style=for-the-badge&logo=x&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn 的 Twitter\" width=\"159\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC46TYUp8WpcFub8NxuGA66A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Sebastrn&color=e78a4e&labelColor=7f1620&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn 的 YouTube\" width=\"125\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/itssebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=ItsSebastrn&color=e78a4e&labelColor=7f1620&style=for-the-badge&logo=twitch&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn 的 Twitch\" width=\"148\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Sebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Sebastrn&color=e78a4e&labelColor=7f1620&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn 的 GitHub\" width=\"125\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-cooking\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Refined_Cooking/BH_RC_ACLink.png\" alt=\"Applied Cooking 宣傳圖\" width=\"1808\" height=\"268\"></a></p>",
